OL,3,GNEWSABoxing scholarship gives students
OL,4,Afighting chance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Rotherham school has welcomed a local
OL,7,Fworld champion boxer to launch its
OL,8,Fboxing scholarship programme.
OL,10,FMaltby Academy Trust said it was
OL,11,F"incredibly proud" of the programme,
OL,12,Fwhich offers "elite-level coaching with
OL,13,Fhigh-quality education" for 16 to 19
OL,14,Fyear-olds.
OL,16,FSheffield's Dalton Smith, the current
OL,17,FWorld Boxing Council (WBC)
OL,18,Fsuper-lightweight title holder, joined
OL,19,Fother fighters from the region for a
OL,20,Fworkout at the launch event, and shared
OL,21,Fstories from his career.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
