OL,3,GNEWSABoxing scholarship gives students
OL,4,Afighting chance
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmith hailed the programme, saying:
OL,7,F"You've got the exercise, a healthy
OL,8,Froutine and a positive way of dealing
OL,9,Fwith things, especially with mental
OL,10,Fhealth being such a big part of society
OL,11,Fnow."
